After having played NetHack for 3 years (first year on/off) I finally made my 
first ascension. I always play as a lawful monk, preferably starting with 
a spellbook of healing.

I found speed boots from a shop in dlvl 2. I descended past the oracle and did
Sokoban and found BoH. Then I went to Minetown and Mine's End to get luckstone.
Mine's End was the version with wine cellar. I didn't have a pick-axe so I
killed a few peaceful dwarves to get one and finally dug my way to get the
luckstone.

I continued descending down the dungeon and found altars on levels 14, 17, 20, 
23, 24 and 25. As I progressed, I converted them and made holy water. Then I 
blessed all my potions of extra and full healing to raise my MaxHP. I dug my 
way past Medusa level and came up to her room from below to kill her. Got some
spellbooks from the statues.

My main worry was my lacking of amulet of reflection. When I came to the Castle
entrance, there was a black dragon at the next square. I nearly panicked, but
then I got the idea to read a scroll of taming. My new pet helped me to clear
the castle but he died in combat. I got wand of wishing. I wished for 2 blessed
scrolls of charging, amulet of reflection and gauntlets of power.

I descended to the Valley of Dead, killed everyone and set up a stash next to
the altar. I ascended back to the main dungeon and explored every vault for
Ludios to no avail. Then I did the quest. Just before entering Master Kaen's
lair I didn't have amulet of free action so I wished for it. Kaen was an easy
kill, I levitated over lava and cast a sleep spell on him, then beat him to
death.

After the quest I descended to the Gehennom, killed Juiblex and descended
further to do Vlad to get the candelbraum and mark the vibrating square. I 
also dug many shortcuts so my return would be as fast as possible. Then I
did Wizard's tower, killing him with a wand of death. I looted his spellbook
and found my way to the vibrating square to do the ritual.

After the ritual I killed the high priest and got the amulet. Then I begun
ascending. At first it was a slow process because I didn't kill Baalzebub
and Asmodeus before getting the amulet. I also got teleported down a few
times. The wizard did not give me a hard time. Every time he resurrected
I zapped him with a wand of death.

I ascended to the main dungeon and then to the planes. I had never been there
before, so I kept on reading this page:

<http://www.statslab.cam.ac.uk/~eva/nethack/endgame.html>

When I got to the Astral Plane, I killed Pestilence and Famine with a wand
of death. I explored the temples only to find that the last one was the
right one. Death was against me before the last temple and he dropped my
MaxHP from ~250 to 92 and killed me once. I teleport-zapped enemies out of 
my way and ran to the altar to offer the amulet and finally ascended!

This was my second game where I got the amulet. My last game ended the other 
day because the Wizard used touch of death and killed me. My strategics and
tactics have vastly improved over last months and still continue to improve.
This was my first game where I used alchemy. I genocided L, h and ; and I was
a weaponless vegan.

